Package: prognosis
Type: Package
Title: Survival Analysis for Prognostic Studies
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("V.", "Moreno", email = "v.moreno@iconcologia.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Kaplan-Meier estimation with rank tests, and Cox proportional
    hazards regression, with compact output for teaching and reporting.
    Ideas taken from the jamovi modules deathwatch, jYS and jsurvival.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jmvcore (>= 2.4), R6, survival, ggplot2, gtable, scales
